      "result": "{\"cards\":[{\"name\":\"Serra Avatar\",\"rules\":[\"{this}\\u0027s power and toughness are each equal to the number of your life total.\",\"When {this} is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner\\u0027s library.\"]},{\"name\":\"Crystal Ball\",\"rules\":[\"{1}, {T}: Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom and the rest on top in any order.)\"]},{\"name\":\"Enigma Sphinx\",\"rules\":[\"Flying\",\"When {this} is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, put it into your library third from the top.\",\"Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)\"]},{\"name\":\"Primordial Mist\",\"rules\":[\"At the beginning of your end step, you may manifest the top card of your library. (Put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up at any time for its mana cost if it\\u0027s a creature card.)\",\"Exile a face-down permanent you control face up: You may play that card this turn.\"]},{\"name\":\"Djinn of Wishes\",\"rules\":[\"Flying\",\"{this} enters with three wish counters on it.\",\"{2}{U}{U}, Remove a wish counter from {this}: Reveal the top card of your library. You may play that card without paying its mana cost. If you don\\u0027t, exile it.\"]}],\"success\":true}",
