      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing an untapped land on turn 1 when a tapped land (Sejiri Refuge) is available and there's nothing to cast this turn. This risks not being able to cast a 2-mana signet on turn 2 if they need to play Sejiri Refuge as their turn 2 land drop (which enters tapped).",
