    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem3F Optim cast Ninja of the Deep Hours from hand for {3}{U} during precombat main, but has a face-down manifest creature (Enigma Sphinx) on the battlefield. With no opposing creatures on the board, the manifest would almost certainly go unblocked, allowing Ninjutsu for {1}{U} - saving 2 mana, getting the combat damage draw trigger, and returning the manifest to hand (which could then be cast as Enigma Sphinx later).",
      "action_taken": "Cast Ninja of the Deep Hours from hand for full cost {3}{U} in precombat main phase",
      "better_line": "Attack with the face-down manifest creature, then if unblocked, activate Ninjutsu {1}{U} to put Ninja of the Deep Hours onto the battlefield attacking, draw a card from the combat damage trigger, and return the manifest (Enigma Sphinx) to hand for future casting",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 391,
