      "decision_index": 521,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Both opponents have all lands tapped, meaning there's minimal threat this turn cycle. Crystal Ball (cost {3}) could have been deployed now to start improving card quality, while Utter End could be held up next turn when all lands are untapped.",
