      "decision_index": 554,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "With Utter End on the stack (likely targeting the manifest or Primordial Mist), Gem3F declined to use Primordial Mist's ability to exile the face-down Enigma Sphinx face-up, which would have allowed casting it this turn. With 0 cards in hand and 8 untapped lands producing the right colors (4WUB = 7 mana), casting Enigma Sphinx with cascade would have been a massive value play, especially given their empty hand.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to activate Primordial Mist's ability to exile the manifested Enigma Sphinx face-up",
      "better_line": "Activate Primordial Mist to exile the manifested Enigma Sphinx face-up in response to Utter End, then cast Enigma Sphinx for 4WUB to get a 4/4 flyer plus cascade value",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 416,
