      "decision_index": 560,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "In a 1v1 situation, Gem3F declined to block what appears to be Mishra's Factory (a 2/2). Blocking with Manifest: Plains (a face-down Plains card with no creature value) would trade a worthless 2/2 manifest for GLM47's Mishra's Factory, permanently removing a utility land from their opponent.",
