      "decision_index": 584,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F declined to use any abilities during combat with 0 cards in hand. They could have turned Loyal Unicorn face-up for {3}{W} to give attacking creatures vigilance and prevent combat damage to them, or used Primordial Mist to exile Enigma Sphinx and cast it for cascade value to rebuild their empty hand.",
