      "decision_index": 587,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F Optim declined to use Primordial Mist's activated ability to exile a face-down manifested creature (Loyal Unicorn or Enigma Sphinx) to play it. With 0 cards in hand and in a 1v1 against GLM47 at 15hp, converting a 2/2 manifest into a real creature (Loyal Unicorn at 3/4 for 4 mana, which is castable with available mana) would provide incremental board advantage.",
