      "decision_index": 587,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "In a 1v1 with GLM47 at 15 life vs Gem3F at 22 life, GLM47 declined to activate Mishra's Factory during combat. The opponent has no creatures to block, so attacking for 2 damage would be free value. With no instants in hand to hold up mana for, there's no reason not to attack.",
