    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Putting Eel Umbra on Paradise Druid (a mana dork) instead of Cold-Eyed Selkie in a 1v1 situation where card advantage is critical. Cold-Eyed Selkie as a 2/2 with umbra armor could draw cards on combat damage, which is much more impactful than protecting a mana dork when GLM47 already has 8 lands.",
