    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Cold-Eyed Selkie is 8/6 without trample. Not blocking means taking 8 damage (16→8 life) AND letting the opponent draw 8 cards from Selkie's triggered ability. Blocking with even one 2/2 Manifest creature would have prevented all combat damage to the player and all card draws, since Selkie doesn't have trample.",
