    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At 6 HP in a 1v1 against an opponent at 14 HP, Gem3F declined to cast Primordial Mist or take any other available action. With GLM47's lands all tapped, this was a safe window to develop the board. Primordial Mist would provide incremental card advantage through manifesting, and a manifest creature could serve as a blocker or enable Yuriko ninjutsu. Passing here wastes mana and tempo in a position where Gem3F is significantly behind on life.",
