      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 487,
      "player": "Gem3F Optim",
      "decision_index": 677,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "GLM47 Grudge has all lands tapped and no creatures on the battlefield, meaning Gem3F could attack with both Pilgrim's Eye (1/1 flying) and the face-down Manifest (2/2) for 3 unblockable damage with zero risk. At 6 HP vs opponent's 14 HP, every point of free damage is critical.",
