      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 488,
      "player": "Gem3F Optim",
      "decision_index": 679,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to use Primordial Mist's ability to exile the face-down Loyal Subordinate and cast it this turn. While Aminatou isn't on the battlefield so the Lieutenant ability wouldn't trigger, getting a 3/1 body on board is still valuable when Gem3F is at 6 life and needs to deal 14 damage to the remaining opponent. Every creature matters in this race situation.",
