      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 488,
      "player": "Gem3F Optim",
      "decision_index": 679,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Primordial Mist's end step trigger allows Gem3F to manifest the top card of their library for free, creating a 2/2 creature. At 6 life with only lands on the battlefield and facing potential threats, declining a free 2/2 body is giving up value for no reason. Even if the manifested card isn't a creature that can be flipped, a 2/2 blocker could be the difference between surviving another turn or not. This is a pure-upside ability with no downside.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to manifest the top card of their library from Primordial Mist's trigger.",
      "better_line": "Accept the Primordial Mist trigger and manifest the top card, getting a free 2/2 creature that could serve as a blocker or be flipped face-up later.",
      "type": "blunder",
