      "decision_index": 680,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Selecting Kenrith's Transformation to return with Mantle of the Ancients attaches it to their own creature, turning it into a 3/3 Elk that loses all abilities. While it does contribute +1/+1 from Mantle's count and draws a card on ETB, it removes the creature's native abilities and sets base power/toughness to 3/3, which is counterproductive when trying to build a voltron threat.",
